# What Vercel deploys is decided by vercel.json: ONE function built from
# api/server.js (the whole Express app -- routes and helpers are bundled
# into it, not turned into functions of their own, which is what broke
# the first build against the Hobby plan's limit of 12), plus the pages,
# impuls.css, assets/ and the rules PDF as static files.
#
# The database connection comes from DATABASE_URL_UNPOOLED / DATABASE_URL,
# which the Neon integration sets. SESSION_SECRET must be set by hand.
#
# Nothing below is needed at runtime.
api/test
api/scripts
db
qa_frontend.ps1
